            {
              "id": "1775661012915_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Instructions:\nYou will receive two blocks of information:\n\nContact Details: {{$context.$nodes.GET_MEETING_CONTACT_DETAILS.$output}}\nMeeting Details: {{$context.$nodes.GET_MEETING_DETAILS_ELASTIC.$output}}\nPlease generate an output in the following JSON format:\n\n\"meetingDetails\": {\n    \"activityId\": \"\",        // Use 'activity' from Meeting Details\n    \"title\": \"\",             // Use 'Subject' from Meeting Details\n    \"dateTime\": \"\",          // Use 'date' from Meeting Details. Format: MMM DD, YYYY, h:mm–h:mm AM/PM TZ\n    \"location\": \"\",          // Use 'location' from Meeting Details. If blank, try to extract meeting location info (Zoom, Teams, Meeting room, etc.) from Activity description. If virtual location add the exact link of the meeting. If not found, leave blank. \n    \"contacts\": \"\",          // From Contact Details, For each Contact concatenate 'Name' and 'Job Title' for each contact, separated by commas.If not able to identify the Job title then mention only the name.\n    \"salesTeam\": \"\"          // From Meeting Details, concatenate Sales Resource 'name' and 'designation', separated by commas. If not able to identify the designation, mention only then name.\n  },\n\"footer\": \"\"\n\nProcessing Notes:\n\nExtract information as specifically as possible from the given data blocks.\nFor contacts and salesTeam, each entry should be presented as \"Name (Job Title)\" or \"Name (Designation)\".\nIf any field cannot be found or extracted, leave it as an empty string.\nFor contacts, process each contact in the list and don't leave any contact \n\nFor footer :\n\"footer\": \"Generated on <MMM DD, YYYY, hh:mm AM/PM TZ> by Agentic AI.\" \nUse today's datetime to stamp into Footer:\n{{$context.$system.$currentDateTime}} (UTC)"
            }
          ],
